    <detaileddescription>
<para>creates a using directive with unique C# identifier uid. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>uid</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>a unique key representing the C# declaration </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>levels</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>number of components of the name</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
pops of levels names from the name stack, assembles them to a single name and creates a new SgUsingDeclaration. The new IR node will get uid as its unique ID.</para><para>namestack-&gt;Text-&gt;System usingDirective(x, 2) =&gt; &quot;System.Text&quot; <simplesect kind="note"><para>currently a hidden namespace with the name is created </para></simplesect>
